---
import { site } from '../../config/site';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const qa = [['How is temp mail different from an alias?', 'Temp mail expires after a short window. An alias stays active and forwards messages for accounts you keep.'], ['Can I use it without registering?', 'Disposable inboxes and test identity tools need no account. Lasting settings require one.'], ['How long is mail stored?', 'Mailbox lifetime and message retention are controlled by the operator settings. The account center shows the actual expiry time for each mailbox.'], ['Are generated identities real?', 'No. They follow common formatting rules but do not represent a real person or household.'], ['Can I connect my own domain?', 'Yes. After ownership and mail records are verified, aliases can use your domain.'], ['Is forwarding transparent?', 'Forwarding requires the operator to configure the inbound and delivery service. Once enabled, handling follows the privacy policy and console description.'], ['Can sites reject temp mail?', 'Yes. A lasting alias or a domain you own is more appropriate when an account needs stable recovery.'], ['Can it receive Internet mail now?', 'Accounts, mailboxes, membership, points, domains and OpenAPI use the database. Internet delivery additionally requires MX records and an inbound mail gateway configured by the operator.']];
---
<Layout locale="en" title="Frequently asked questions · NodeMail"><header class="directory-hero"><div class="shell" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h1>Frequently asked questions</h1><p>Clear answers about disposable inboxes, lasting aliases, forwarding and test identities.</p></div></header><section class="section"><div class="shell faq-page-grid"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">ALL QUESTIONS</p><h2>Choose by how long the account must last</h2></div><div class="faq-list" data-reveal>{qa.map(([question, answer], index) => <details class="faq-item"><summary><span class="faq-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span class="faq-question">{question}</span><span class="faq-plus">+</span></summary><p class="faq-answer">{answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="shell cta-inner" data-reveal><h2>Still not sure which one fits?</h2><p>Use temp mail for a one-off code and an alias for a lasting account.</p><div class="cta-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href={site.appPath}>Open temp mail</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/en/contact/">Contact us</a></div></div></section></Layout>
